Hash":1357362114,"text":"試してるところだ。","nextNodeIds":[150020406]},{"nodeId":150020406,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1573990682,"text":"本当か？オイラたちにも教えてくれ！","nextNodeIds":[150020407]},{"nodeId":150020407,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":2945815490,"text":"パイモン、俺に用があったんじゃないか？","nextNodeIds":[150020408]},{"nodeId":150020408,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2551041842,"text":"あっ、そうだった。ええと、なんだっけ？…あっ！そうそうアハウのことだ。あいつ、本当に失礼なやつだよな！","nextNodeIds":[150020409]},{"nodeId":150020409,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2057279746,"text":"今日はいないの？","nextNodeIds":[150020410]},{"nodeId":150020410,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":1468675290,"text":"確かにあいつは性格がひん曲がってる。だから、ある先生にしつけてもらうことにした。","nextNodeIds":[150020411]},{"nodeId":150020411,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":137219386,"text":"しつける？へへっ、あいつが厳しくしつけられてるところ、ちょっと見てみたいな！","nextNodeIds":[150020412]},{"nodeId":150020412,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1013239146,"text":"あれ？でもあいつの話だと、おまえたちはアビスの気配を調べてるとか言ってたぞ…この件となにか関係があるのか？","nextNodeIds":[150020413]},{"nodeId":150020413,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":3080067506,"text":"ああ、それがまさに俺の試してる方法だ。","nextNodeIds":[150020414]},{"nodeId":150020414,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":2543086578,"text":"俺は竜狩り人だが、時にアビスを狩ることもある。以前、紫の魔犬を追っていたら、ある隠された空間に足を踏み入れてな。","nextNodeIds":[150020415]},{"nodeId":150020415,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":4285031938,"text":"あとで資料を調べると、そこは獣域と呼ばれる場所だと分かった。獣域の規模は大小さまざまで、その紫の魔犬もそこから出てくるものだった。","nextNodeIds":[150020416]},{"nodeId":150020416,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":806098338,"text":"それがどう関係してるんだ…？","nextNodeIds":[150020417]},{"nodeId":150020417,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":856219778,"text":"獣域を見つけ、その中のものをすべて取り除き、山の王を入れてやれば…生きていても部族を脅かすことがなくなる。","nextNodeIds":[150020418]},{"nodeId":150020418,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2167649522,"text":"いやいや！方法がちょっと雑すぎないか…ほんとに上手くいくのかよ？","nextNodeIds":[150020419]},{"nodeId":150020419,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":613596226,"text":"当然、いくつか問題もある。例えば山の王が獣域に長くいた場合、状況が悪化する可能性も否めない。","nextNodeIds":[150020420]},{"nodeId":150020420,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":991294330,"text":"だが一時的な解決策とはいえ、今の俺たちには必要だ。それに部族内の対立は、何も昨日今日に始まったことじゃない。","nextNodeIds":[150020421]},{"nodeId":150020421,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":4015398746,"text":"族長はどうしても、山の王を守りたいと考えてる。","nextNodeIds":[150020422]},{"nodeId":150020422,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2755607826,"text":"たしかに…ワイナは山の王じゃなくて、あくまで部族の文化と栄誉を守りたいんだよな。","nextNodeIds":[150020423]},{"nodeId":150020423,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":1951118834,"text":"ああ。だが一方で、トリニダードは目の前のことや将来のこと、そして身の回りの人のことを大切に思ってる。","nextNodeIds":[150020424]},{"nodeId":150020424,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":734888066,"text":"これも理解できることだ。家族や友人の命を犠牲にし、過去の栄誉を守ったところで…","nextNodeIds":[150020425]},{"nodeId":150020425,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":3675825338,"text":"それがいいことなのか…残された者の代わりに答えることなど誰もできない。","nextNodeIds":[150020426]},{"nodeId":150020426,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":509704250,"text":"本当に難しいな…まぁ、ひとまずその問題は置いとくとして…仮におまえの計画通りに行動する場合、その獣域はどうやって探すつもりなんだ？","nextNodeIds":[150020427]},{"nodeId":150020427,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":949822866,"text":"あの犬たちって、急に裂け目から出てきて襲ってくるけど、こっちから攻撃を仕掛けに行ったことなんてないぞ。","nextNodeIds":[150020428]},{"nodeId":150020428,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":3389650098,"text":"場所の見当はもうついてる。","nextNodeIds":[150020429]},{"nodeId":150020429,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2828619346,"text":"本当に探すつもりなの？","nextNodeIds":[150020430]},{"nodeId":150020430,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":614704146,"text":"なら、別の方法があるのか？","nextNodeIds":[150020431]},{"nodeId":150020431,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2024496050,"text":"ないけど…でも、アビスの力を利用すると、なんだか不幸なことが起きそうな気がして…","nextNodeIds":[150020432]},{"nodeId":150020432,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2181204050,"text":"山の王を今の姿にしたのだって、アビスの力だろ。他の人もきっと頷いてくれないんじゃないか…","nextNodeIds":[150020433]},{"nodeId":150020433,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":2507505410,"text":"もし不幸なことが起きたとしたら、それは払うべき代償だったということだ。この世のすべてには値段がついてる。炎を盗むユパンキだって例外じゃない。","nextNodeIds":[150020434]},{"nodeId":150020434,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":2325233186,"text":"今回、山の王が突如暴走したことによって、部族内の対立はより激しくなった。一刻も早く解決しなければ、誰も前に進めない。","nextNodeIds":[150020435]},{"nodeId":150020435,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":281147618,"text":"そうだな…ところで、おまえが言ってた取引ってなんだ？オイラたち、アビスの力のことは別に詳しくないけど…","nextNodeIds":[150020436]},{"nodeId":150020436,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":3641979058,"text":"俺のために時間を稼いでくれればそれでいい。","nextNodeIds":[150020437]},{"nodeId":150020437,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":18181330,"text":"遊火者をやってくれと、毎日説得に来るやつがいるんだ。だが、そいつらの相手で時間を無駄にしたくない。","nextNodeIds":[150020438]},{"nodeId":150020438,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":1020790890,"text":"もし手を貸してくれるのなら、報酬も渡そう。","nextNodeIds":[150020439]},{"nodeId":150020439,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1097873418,"text":"報酬って？","nextNodeIds":[150020440]},{"nodeId":150020440,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":1537328378,"text":"その働きに見合う報酬だ。","nextNodeIds":[150020441]},{"nodeId":150020441,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":733465258,"text":"何をすればいいの？","nextNodeIds":[150020442]},{"nodeId":150020442,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":4256302674,"text":"これまで同様、部族の人間に顔を覚えてもらう。そして、新たな遊火者が来たと知ってもらえばいい。","nextNodeIds":[150020443]},{"nodeId":150020443,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":280548306,"text":"そうすれば、俺は儀式をやるよう言ってくるやつらを避け、獣域を呼び出す方法を考えるのに時間を充てられる。","nextNodeIds":[150020444]},{"nodeId":150020444,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":759696898,"text":"決行は儀式の当日——その日、山の王には棲み処を移ってもらう。","nextNodeIds":[150020445]},{"nodeId":150020445,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":314474010,"text":"めちゃくちゃだな…キィニチ、おまえの「冒険心」ってどうなってんだよ…","nextNodeIds":[150020446]},{"nodeId":150020446,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3240595562,"text":"もし族長やトリニダードたちがこの方法に反対したら、どうなるかちゃんと考えたのか？","nextNodeIds":[150020447]},{"nodeId":150020447,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":3189970002,"text":"その時、あいつらはまた同じ陣営となって、俺はその反対側に立つだけだ。","nextNodeIds":[150020448]},{"nodeId":150020448,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":656102226,"text":"部族に必要なのは、あいつらのようなリーダーだ。俺みたいな金で仕事する竜狩り人じゃない。","nextNodeIds":[150020449]},{"nodeId":150020449,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1605563546,"text":"今回は誰もお金を払ってくれないんでしょ。","nextNodeIds":[150020450]},{"nodeId":150020450,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":1604510106,"text":"フッ、同意したってことでいいのか？","nextNodeIds":[150020451]},{"nodeId":150020451,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3220642810,"text":"とりあえずやってみよう。","nextNodeIds":[150020452]},{"nodeId":150020452,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1246379210,"text":"そうだな。もしかしたら、この数日間のうちにもっといい方法が思いつくかもしれないし！","nextNodeIds":[150020453]},{"nodeId":150020453,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":3005735378,"text":"ああ。これからしばらく、集落内を歩き回りながら部族のやつらを手伝ってくれ。遊火者のお前なら、きっと人気者になれるだろう。","nextNodeIds":[150020454]},{"nodeId":150020454,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":3631084618,"text":"上手くいくことを祈ってる。","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1500204,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_POINT","LNHLPKELCAL":["[3_350200032:-2174.743,243.935,8444.999]"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_LOCATION"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[1500201,1500202,1500203,1500204],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","count":50},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","count":38},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","count":20},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","spea